From 8b6eb70e1f1ef675300d60477c2886d4f904b354 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blossom-family <blossom-family@local>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:32:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/22] arm64: dts: add the rest of the blossom family overlays

Imported from MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource (branch dandelion-q-oss,
the official single source for Redmi 9A/9C/POCO C3):

  dandelion  : Redmi 9A / 9i / 9i Sport / 10A      (already present)
  angelica   : Redmi 9C
  angelican  : Redmi 9C NFC
  angelicain : POCO C3 / C31
  cattail    : Redmi 9 Active / 9 India / 9A Sport / 9AT

- add angelica/angelican/angelicain/cattail .dts overlays
- generate their cust.dtsi from the official .dws via tools/dct/DrvGen.py
- add the matching .dws files under dws/mt6765
- blossom_defconfig: build all five DTBO overlays

Verified: all five overlays compile (dtc) and merge with mt6765.dtb
via scripts/dtc/ufdt_apply_overlay.  Runtime testing on real 9C / C3 /
cattail units is still required.
